// OpsGaurd management-plane gRPC contract between the server (OpsGaurdWeb)
// and the Worker agent.
//
// This service replaces the previous HTTP management API (workerproxy ↔
// orchestrator/api.go). The node-level local API (nodeagent, used for
// manager↔node proxying) stays on HTTP and is out of scope.
//
